      "field_name": "other_symptoms_established",
      "value": "parkinsonism; weakness; stiffness; resting tremor",
      "quote": "During hospitalization, left-leg resting tremor and rigidity was observed on top of left side spastic hypertonia.\nBradykinesia could not be properly evaluated due to hypertonia.\nShe underwent FP-CIT PET, which revealed bilaterally reduced uptake which is more severe on the right side ( Fig. 1 ).\nShe was treated with levodopa up to 1000 mg/day (250 mg qid), with marked improvement in rigidity and left leg resting tremor, although she was still dependent due to weakness and stiffness.",
